    "type": "question",
    "label": "36",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{9p^2-81q^2}{3p-9q}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$3(p+3q)$, for real $p,q$ with $p\\ne3q$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{9p^2-81q^2}{3p-9q}&=\\frac{9(p-3q)(p+3q)}{3(p-3q)}\\\\\\frac{9p^2-81q^2}{3p-9q}&=3(p+3q)\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: real $p,q$ with $p\\ne3q$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
